DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261104T210000
DTSTAMP:20261105T195930Z
UID:171872c4b4cce234652f0ec58fd3@montreal-independent-music
CATEGORIES:Independent Music\,Experimental Music
DESCRIPTION:In honor of CKUT's 2026 Existence Referendum\, where we're ask
